  "keyFeatures": [
    "Real-time P&L (Estado de Resultados) calculated from POS data",
    "Food Cost, Beverage Cost, and Labor Cost vs industry benchmarks",
    "Cash ledger (Estado de Cuenta de Efectivo) replacing Excel tracking",
    "Menu Engineering matrix classifying dishes as Star, Puzzle, Plowhorse, or Dog",
    "Automated KPI alerts with green/yellow/red traffic-light status",
    "Star Employees — waiter performance ranking by sales",
    "Tiendita Inteligente — AI-powered purchase suggestions based on real sales",
    "Live shift data for real-time manager dashboards",
    "Webhooks for event-driven integrations",
    "Idempotent ingestion endpoints to prevent duplicate data"
  ],
